# Agent Wave 3 — Customer care drafts (learned / shipped)

**Status:** Live on feature branch + local dev. **Not full auto-reply** — template draft → human Edit → Send only.

Verified example (Messages → Draft with Agent → `/admin/agent/inbound`):

- Customer: Rachele, subject *「Can you print large stickers for a bill kart?」*
- Inbound excerpt shows full contact-form body (phone included).
- Intent hint: `bespoke_product` (print/sticker language; admin label **Custom print / stickers**).
- Draft: `Dear Rachele,` + custom print opening + quoted *You wrote:* + ask for size (mm) / quantity / artwork + Selpic Customer Care sign-off.
- Subject: `Re: Can you print large stickers for a bill kart?`
- Admin must click **Send via Resend** — nothing sends automatically.

---

## Product contract (do not break)

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| **HITL default** | Generate draft only. **No** auto-send, no auto status change until admin Send. |
| **Autonomy** | L1 — same as unified plan. L2 auto-send is **out of scope** for inbound until explicitly requested. |
| **English copy** | All draft templates and admin UI labels in English. |
| **Homepage** | No agent widget or capture on `app/page.tsx`. |
| **Accounting** | Never import `apps/accounting-sandbox/**` into agent paths. |

---

## User journeys (must keep working)

### A — From Messages

1. `/admin/messages` → select row → **Draft with Agent** (Reply旁边, indigo).
2. Navigates to `/admin/agent/inbound?channel=message&id=<uuid>`.
3. Queue pre-selects that message; excerpt + draft populate right panel.
4. **Replied / closed** messages: still load via deep-link (single GET), flagged `deepLinkOnly` — not only `new`/`read`.

### B — From Bespoke

Same pattern with `channel=bespoke&id=…` (status `new`/`reviewed` in default queue; deep-link fetches any status).

### C — From Agent hub

`/admin/agent` → Customer care stats / attention banner → **Open draft workspace** → `/admin/agent/inbound` **without** `?channel=&id=`.

**Learned (ops 2026-09):** Hub “Open workspace” with an empty left list is **not a bug** when every Message/Bespoke row is already `replied` / `approved` / etc. Admins who only used **Draft with Agent** on finished rows expected a full history page; the workspace is a **triage queue**, not Messages/Bespoke history.

**UX contract (shipped):**

| Tab | Statuses | Empty-state behaviour |
|-----|----------|------------------------|
| **Needs attention** | message `new`/`read`; bespoke `new`/`reviewed` | Explain filter; link to **Recently handled** if any; else Messages/Bespoke + “Draft with Agent” |
| **Recently handled** | message `replied`/`closed`; bespoke `replied`/`approved`/`rejected` (cap 40) | Allow follow-up draft/Send; after Send, switch to this tab |

Hub summary cards still count **`new` only** — narrower than Needs attention (which also includes `read` / `reviewed`). Do not “fix” empty hub→workspace by dumping all statuses into Needs attention.

