## Draft body shape (messages channel)

Fixed sections — preserve order when editing logic:

1. `Dear {customerName},`
2. Intent-specific opening (or generic receipt ack)
3. `You wrote:` + quoted excerpt (max ~400 chars in quote via `excerpt()`)
4. Closing ask (order # / photos **or** payment-dispute safety line)
5. `Kind regards,` / `Selpic Customer Care` / `https://selpic.com.au`

Bespoke channel uses separate template (request id in subject when present).

