## Permissions (send path)

| Action | Permission |
|--------|------------|
| Hub / summary | `agent:read` (+ legacy aliases) |
| Inbound page enter | `messages:read` OR `bespoke:read` OR `agent:read` |
| Generate draft API | same as enter |
| **Send** | `messages:write` (message) / `bespoke:write` (bespoke) — enforced in `sendAdminComposeEmailAction` + UI disable |

Read-only staff may draft; cannot Send.

