## What is NOT implemented (future waves)

- **LLM** grounding / OpenAI call — add adapter **behind** `buildInboundReplyDraft` or parallel `buildInboundReplyDraftLlm()`; keep template fallback.
- **Auto-send** on new inbound — forbidden without new permission + audit design.
- **Storefront chat widget** — separate project; still HITL if added.
- **`agent:run`** — catalog only; not wired to inbound.
- **agent_runs** SQL / shared run history (Phase B2).

