## Safe extension checklist (next dev session)

1. Read this rule + `docs/selpic-unified-ai-agent-plan.md` Wave 3–4.
2. Print/sticker Contact templates + classifier priority are **shipped** (see tests). Next optional: LLM behind `buildInboundReplyDraft` with template fallback — not required to close Wave 3.
3. Any new send path → `messages:write` / `bespoke:write` + `logAdminActivity`.
4. Deep-link + replied status → add test in `lib/agent/inboundQueue.test.ts`.
5. Do not remove Edit step or shorten excerpt below what admin needs to verify customer text.
6. Commit/deploy only when user asks.

